。","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2111683189429182780"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-18T04:55:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111682610778849397"],"id":"2111682610778849397","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":11869,"like_count":159,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":96,"retweet_count":17},"text":"有人吃过蒋介屎的石吗，指尖截进那滩温吞的糜软时，它便像发酵的藕粉般缠上指节，棕褐的膏体在指甲缝里拉出黏连的丝。门齿刚破开表层就挤出半流质的浆，腐坏的甜腥混着沼气在齿间爆开，像咬破一颗灌满沼液的葡萄。日齿研磨时能感觉到未消化的纤维在牙床间弹跳，如同咀嚼泡发的麻绳，每咬合一次就有酸败","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2111682610778849397"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-18T01:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111623298324869447"],"id":"2111623298324869447","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2920,"like_count":40,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":40,"retweet_count":0},"text":"不想上班，昨天挣得100块还没花完，今天再赚100的话我怕赚的太多了，不稳，会烧心","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2111623298324869447"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-17T16:46:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111499064097509381"],"id":"2111499064097509381","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":8998,"like_count":221,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":38,"retweet_count":7},"text":"你是音乐生吧 感觉音劲小小的 有时候甚至找不到调","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2111499064097509381"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-17T16:29:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111494804496605421"],"id":"2111494804496605421","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":31096,"like_count":1914,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":59,"retweet_count":46},"text":"小时候经常用盗版作文网站，在满屏的扔子和大福中认真抄写作文，这也练就了我坚韧不拔的性格，我将他视为上天送我的礼物","url":"https://x.com/tart_egg25188/status/2111494804496605421"},{"author_id":"1804721568955912192","created_at":"2026-10-17T16:07:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111489407945683209"],"id":"2111489407945683209","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":5573,"like_count":93,"quote_count":0,"r